{{!--
  WARRANTY CERTIFICATE — new design (D-1 pilot)
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Replaces the old html2canvas + inline-styled cert. Reads from the
  shared design system; the brand-band top + seal-footer are
  inherited from _layout.hbs so EVERY doc shares the same chrome.

  Layout philosophy:
    - One commanding hero on page 1
    - Tier badge as a small, calm typographic moment (not screaming)
    - Property block as a 2-col key/value grid with hairline rules
    - Guarantee terms in a pull-block with orange accent rail
    - Feature list as a 2-col grid with dot bullets
    - Signature block at the foot of the doc with two lines

  Required template variables:
    owner, address, dateFormatted, work,
    tier (economy|standard|preferred|elite|beyond),
    tierLabel, tierLabelLong, tierTerms, certNumber, isElite, isPreferred,
    isEconomy, isBeyond

  Five tiers (Jo, 2026-10-02): Economy carries the shingle manufacturer's
  standard limited warranty, no system warranty. Beyond is Elite's terms
  (isElite is true) plus TAMKO's HailGuard hail warranty.

  NBD's warranty model (Jo, 2026-10-06, final) — three separate lines:
    pledgeLine       — the NBD Pledge, a PROMISE on every NBD job: "for as
                       long as you own the home, we'll come back and make it
                       right." Never called a "lifetime warranty".
    workmanshipLine  — NBD: the package's WRITTEN labor warranty (Economy 1,
                       Standard 5, Preferred 10, Elite 20 years —
                       estimate-config.js TIER_LABOR_YEARS); another company:
                       its own configured sentence, or '' (no line printed).
    manufacturerLine — the manufacturer warranty THIS job bought (package +
                       any extended warranty sold). Missing → "per
                       manufacturer — see your estimate", never a guess.
  The NBD Pledge prints only when company.isNbd (server-resolved).
--}}

{{!-- D-2.5: shared cover-page partial. Brand-consistent across every
     doc the platform produces; the variables here personalize the
     SAME structure to THIS customer + THIS project.
     The `sub` copy names the NBD Pledge, so it is gated on company.isNbd —
     a stranger tenant renders neutral copy so the cert never advertises
     NBD to another company's homeowner. --}}
{{#if company.isNbd}}
{{> coverPage
  eyebrow="Warranty Certificate · NBD Pledge"
  tagline="Backed by our<br>name on the line."
  sub="This certificate is the homeowner's record of the NBD Pledge — for as long as you own the home, we'll come back and make it right — and of the written warranties on the installation at the property below. Keep it with your important home documents."
  preparedFor=preparedFor
  preparedBy=preparedBy
  projectMeta=projectMeta
}}
{{else if isEconomy}}
{{> coverPage
  eyebrow="Warranty Certificate · 1-Year Labor Warranty"
  tagline="Backed by our<br>name on the line."
  sub="This certificate is the homeowner's record that the installation on the property below carries a one-year labor (workmanship) warranty from the installation date. The shingles carry the manufacturer's standard limited warranty; no system warranty is included. Keep it with your important home documents."
  preparedFor=preparedFor
  preparedBy=preparedBy
  projectMeta=projectMeta
}}
{{else}}
{{> coverPage
  eyebrow="Warranty Certificate"
  tagline="Backed by our<br>name on the line."
  sub="This certificate is the homeowner's record of the warranties that apply to the installation on the property below. Keep it with your important home documents."
  preparedFor=preparedFor
  preparedBy=preparedBy
  projectMeta=projectMeta
}}
{{/if}}

<div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12pt; margin: var(--s-6) 0 var(--s-5); page-break-before: always; break-before: page;">
  {{#if company.isNbd}}
  <span class="badge tier-{{tier}}">{{tier}} · NBD Pledge{{#if laborYears}} · {{laborYears}}-Year Labor Warranty{{/if}}</span>
  {{else if isEconomy}}
  <span class="badge tier-{{tier}}">{{tier}} · 1-Year Labor Warranty</span>
  {{else}}
  <span class="badge tier-{{tier}}">{{tier}} · Warranty</span>
  {{/if}}
  <span class="eyebrow muted">Certificate {{certNumber}}</span>
</div>

<h2>Property &amp; Installation</h2>
<div class="kv-grid">
  <div class="kv span-2">
    <div class="kv-label">Property Address</div>
    <div class="kv-value">{{address}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kv">
    <div class="kv-label">Homeowner of Record</div>
    <div class="kv-value">{{owner}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kv">
    <div class="kv-label">Installation Date</div>
    <div class="kv-value">{{dateFormatted}}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kv span-2">
    <div class="kv-label">Work Performed</div>
    <div class="kv-value">{{work}}</div>
  </div>
</div>

{{#if tierTerms}}
<h2>What's Guaranteed</h2>
<div class="pull">
  <div>
    <div class="pull-title">{{tierLabelLong}}</div>
    <div class="pull-body">{{tierTerms}}</div>
  </div>
</div>
{{/if}}

<div class="feature-grid">
  {{#if company.isNbd}}
  {{!-- NBD (Jo, 2026-10-06): the Pledge (a promise, every tier), then the
       package's WRITTEN labor warranty, then the manufacturer's. Never
       "lifetime warranty". --}}
  <div class="feature">{{#if pledgeLine}}{{pledgeLine}}{{else}}NBD Pledge: for as long as you own the home, we'll come back and make it right.{{/if}}</div>
  <div class="feature">{{#if workmanshipLine}}{{workmanshipLine}}{{else}}Written workmanship (labor) warranty per your package — see your estimate{{/if}}</div>
  <div class="feature">{{#if manufacturerLine}}{{manufacturerLine}}{{else if isEconomy}}Shingle manufacturer's standard limited warranty (no system warranty){{else if manufacturerWarrantyFeature}}Manufacturer warranty: {{manufacturerWarrantyFeature}}{{else}}Manufacturer warranty: per manufacturer — see your estimate{{/if}}</div>
  {{else}}
  {{#if isEconomy}}
  <div class="feature">1-year labor warranty from the installation date</div>
  <div class="feature">{{#if manufacturerLine}}{{manufacturerLine}}{{else}}Shingle manufacturer's standard limited warranty (no system warranty){{/if}}</div>
  {{else}}
  {{#if workmanshipLine}}<div class="feature">{{workmanshipLine}}</div>{{/if}}
  <div class="feature">{{#if manufacturerLine}}{{manufacturerLine}}{{else if manufacturerWarrantyFeature}}Manufacturer warranty: {{manufacturerWarrantyFeature}}{{else}}Manufacturer warranty: per manufacturer — see your estimate{{/if}}</div>
  {{/if}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if company.isNbd}}
  {{#if isPreferred}}<div class="feature">Transferable to new owner on sale of property</div>{{/if}}
  {{#if isElite}}<div class="feature">Annual courtesy inspection included</div>{{/if}}
  {{#if isElite}}<div class="feature">Fully transferable — follows the property through all subsequent owners</div>{{/if}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if company.isNbd}}<div class="feature">Backed personally by Joe Deal</div>{{else}}<div class="feature">Backed by {{company.footerName}}</div>{{/if}}
  {{#if company.isNbd}}<div class="feature">Recorded on file at NBD Home Solutions</div>{{else}}<div class="feature">Recorded on file at {{company.footerName}}</div>{{/if}}
</div>

<p class="meta" style="margin-top:18pt; line-height:1.6;">{{#if company.isNbd}}This guarantee covers defects in labor and workmanship only. It does not cover damage caused by acts of nature, severe weather events, improper maintenance, or modifications made by parties other than {{company.footerName}}. {{else}}{{#if workmanshipLine}}This guarantee covers defects in labor and workmanship only. It does not cover damage caused by acts of nature, severe weather events, improper maintenance, or modifications made by parties other than {{company.footerName}}. {{/if}}{{/if}}{{#if isEconomy}}The shingle manufacturer's standard limited warranty is a separate warranty provided directly by the manufacturer and is not administered by {{company.footerName}}.{{else}}{{#if manufacturer}}The {{manufacturer}} manufacturer shingle warranty{{#if isBeyond}} (including the HailGuard hail warranty){{/if}} is a separate warranty provided directly by {{manufacturer}}{{else}}The manufacturer shingle warranty is a separate warranty provided directly by the shingle manufacturer{{/if}} and is not administered by {{company.footerName}}.{{/if}}</p>

<div class="sig-block">
  <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Signatures</h2>
  <div class="sig-grid">
    <div class="sig">
      <div class="sig-line"></div>
      <div class="sig-caption">Homeowner Signature &amp; Date</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sig">
      <div class="sig-line"></div>
      <div class="sig-caption">{{#if company.isNbd}}Joe Deal{{else}}{{preparedBy.name}}{{/if}} · {{company.footerName}}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{{> affiliateRow}}
